    "updated_at": "2023-06-14T15:07:43Z",
    "body": "The initial value for `line-height` is `normal` so Chromium and Gecko declarations are equivalent.\r\n\r\nI can't get `line-height` have an effect on either dropdown or listbox select in Firefox/Chrome/Safari on macOS. Is there an effect in Linux or Windows?",
